# Options of every Maven run here (wrapper, CI, image build). Transient errors of Maven Central are retried:
# up to 5 times, waiting 5 s longer each time, also for 500, 502 and 504 (the default is 3 times and 429, 503 only).
# -U asks again for what an earlier run did not find, instead of failing on the cached miss for a day.
# A missing artifact still fails the build.
-Daether.connector.http.retryHandler.count=5
-Daether.connector.http.retryHandler.serviceUnavailable=429,500,502,503,504
-U
